# IEEE template files. NOT redistributable, so they are deliberately not committed: obtain ieeeaccess.cls and
# IEEEtran.bst from the IEEE Access author portal (the "LaTeX template" download) and place both in paper/.
# `make check` fails with these instructions until they are present, so that error message stays the onboarding path
# for anyone cloning the repository.
paper/ieeeaccess.cls
paper/IEEEtran.bst
paper/build-smoke/
paper/aase-successor-PREVIEW.pdf
